     python3 -m shelf.cli fine loan.json
     python3 -m unittest
+
+## Renewals
+
+A reader may renew a loan at most twice. Each renewal adds 14 days to the current due date, so renewing early never costs the reader days. A loan that is already late cannot be renewed. The fine of one loan never goes above 5.00 EUR.
+
+    python3 -m shelf.cli renew loan.json
